n  focus on uh agriculture sector a lot of  experts estimated their input of this  region in the general economy were like  50 of GDP you can imagine 50 of GDP it's  obviously a devastating effect on the  Ukrainian economy but what sort of  knock-on effect is that having Beyond  Ukraine Ukraine always was uh and is is  very much uh export oriented country  well we are number four in the world  like agriculture sector we played a very  important role in the Steel Industries  in many others and for example in the  agriculture sector we produced a minimum  five times more than we needed for you  for Ukrainian that's why Ukraine it's  not only a bread basket or Euro but  probably it's a bread basket of all the  world and we know how many countries  depend on our activity first of all the  country of the Northern Africa Middle  East and many other countries who are  depends on our corn wheat sunflower oil  how effective do you think efforts have  been to discourage Western businesses  from continuing to operate in Russia do  you think the message has got through  enough yet  I asking my friends from abroad  businesses but that's a deadline when  you decided to leave your Russia you  needed occupied one country two  countries free country you you still  didn't understand first sign was 2008  Georgia second one 2014 Ukraine Crimea  donbass 22 is a real aggression full  aggression of Russia against Ukraine and  some people still can't you see no we  needed to find some compromise this is  not a war this is a special operation  guys I will buy the ticket to you please  take a train go to give go to the  mariopal and see and after where come  back and say no this is a special  operation and we needed to find some  agreement no and what's your vision for  the economy of Ukraine When The War is  Over honestly speaking in Ukraine all  Ukrainian absolutely sure first we will  be winner in general second Ukraine will  be very popular like example who  protected the peace protected